.TH tkutodo n 0.1 tkutils
.SH tkutils::tkutodo
.PP
A task\-list widget for iCalendar \fBVTODO\fR components, built on \fBtclutils::tuical\fR. Shows summary, due date, priority and percent\-complete in a \fBttk::treeview\fR; in editable mode the done state of a task can be toggled.
.CS
set w [tkutodo::widget .t ?-editable 1? ?-onchange {}?]
pack $w -fill both -expand 1

tkutodo::loadText .t $ics        ;# parse iCal text + extract all VTODOs
tkutodo::setTodos .t $comps      ;# or hand a list of VTODO components
tkutodo::count .t                ;# number of tasks
tkutodo::todos .t                ;# current components (changes included)
tkutodo::toggle .t ?index?       ;# flip done state of selected / given task
.CE
.PP
Toggling a task to done sets \fBSTATUS:COMPLETED\fR, \fBPERCENT\-COMPLETE:100\fR and a \fBCOMPLETED\fR timestamp; toggling back restores \fBNEEDS\-ACTION\fR, \fBPERCENT\-COMPLETE:0\fR and removes \fBCOMPLETED\fR. In editable mode, Space and double\-click also toggle. The \fB\-onchange\fR script is called as \fB{*}$cmd $path\fR after a change, so an app can persist (e.g. \fBtuical::toIcs [tkutodo::todos .t]\fR then PUT via \fBtudav\fR).
